{
  "file": "module4",
  "page": 100,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        66.76272583007812,
        119.47928619384766,
        82.6147232055664
      ],
      "text": "Remarks",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        89.82263946533203,
        527.412841796875,
        104.26564025878906
      ],
      "text": "1.\t The 9-month all-oral regimen consists of bedaquiline (used for 6 months), in combination with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        103.02259063720703,
        527.3311157226562,
        117.46559143066406
      ],
      "text": "levofloxacin/moxifloxacin, ethionamide, ethambutol, isoniazid (high-dose), pyrazinamide and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        116.22272491455078,
        527.3842163085938,
        130.6657257080078
      ],
      "text": "clofazimine (for 4 months, with the possibility of extending to 6 months if the patient remains",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        129.42274475097656,
        524.600341796875,
        143.86573791503906
      ],
      "text": "sputum smear positive at the end of 4  months), followed by treatment with levofloxacin/",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        142.62269592285156,
        527.582275390625,
        157.06568908691406
      ],
      "text": "moxifloxacin, clofazimine, ethambutol and pyrazinamide (for 5 months). Ethionamide can be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        155.8227081298828,
        313.4705505371094,
        170.2657012939453
      ],
      "text": "replaced by 2 months of linezolid (600 mg daily).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        173.2747344970703,
        527.1705322265625,
        187.7177276611328
      ],
      "text": "2.\t  A 9-month regimen with linezolid instead of ethionamide may be used in pregnant women, unlike",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        86.86609649658203,
        186.47474670410156,
        230.25001525878906,
        200.91773986816406
      ],
      "text": "the regimen with ethionamide.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        203.92665100097656,
        236.62672424316406,
        218.36964416503906
      ],
      "text": "3.\t This recommendation applies to:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        221.3786163330078,
        416.3178405761719,
        235.8216094970703
      ],
      "text": "a.\t people with MDR/RR-TB and without resistance to fluoroquinolones;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        238.8306427001953,
        469.20220947265625,
        253.2736358642578
      ],
      "text": "b.\t patients without extensive TB disease  and without severe extrapulmonary TB; 32 33",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        256.28253173828125,
        527.22216796875,
        270.7255554199219
      ],
      "text": "c.\t patients with less than 1 month exposure to bedaquiline, fluoroquinolones, ethionamide,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        269.48248291015625,
        527.4409790039062,
        283.9255065917969
      ],
      "text": "linezolid and clofazimine; when exposure is greater than 1 month, these patients may still",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        282.6826171875,
        527.3914794921875,
        297.1256408691406
      ],
      "text": "receive this regimen if resistance to the specific medicines with such exposure has been ruled",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        295.88262939453125,
        121.63109588623047,
        310.3256530761719
      ],
      "text": "out;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        313.33453369140625,
        264.5519104003906,
        327.7775573730469
      ],
      "text": "d.\t all people regardless of HIV status;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        87.86609649658203,
        330.7864990234375,
        527.4638671875,
        345.2295227050781
      ],
      "text": "e.\t children (and patients in other age groups) who do not have bacteriological confirmation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        343.98651123046875,
        527.3287353515625,
        358.4295349121094
      ],
      "text": "of TB or resistance patterns but who do have a high likelihood of MDR/RR-TB (based on",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        357.1864929199219,
        527.4456787109375,
        371.6295166015625
      ],
      "text": "clinical signs and symptoms of TB, in combination with a history of contact with a patient with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.86609649658203,
        370.3865051269531,
        213.9111785888672,
        384.82952880859375
      ],
      "text": "confirmed MDR/RR-TB).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        398.2037048339844,
        128.1744842529297,
        414.0556945800781
      ],
      "text": "Rationale",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        421.26361083984375,
        527.4222412109375,
        435.7066345214844
      ],
      "text": "The rationale for this recommendation is based on the evidence and considerations described in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        434.4635925292969,
        527.4114379882812,
        448.9066162109375
      ],
      "text": "detail in the following two subsections. The 9-month regimens can be used in patients not eligible",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        447.6636962890625,
        527.3748168945312,
        462.1067199707031
      ],
      "text": "for the shorter, 6-month regimens; also, they represent a preferred treatment option over the longer",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        460.8636169433594,
        527.5751953125,
        475.306640625
      ],
      "text": "regimens. The intention to determine a relatively shorter duration of treatment for patients with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        474.063720703125,
        527.4574584960938,
        488.5067443847656
      ],
      "text": "forms of DR-TB or other eligibility criteria not compatible with the 6-month regimen has driven the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        487.26361083984375,
        246.37881469726562,
        501.7066345214844
      ],
      "text": "assessments presented in this section.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        508.9676513671875,
        527.1863403320312,
        523.41064453125
      ],
      "text": "Briefly, two assessments have been performed: first, comparing the outcomes of the 9-month regimen",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.962937355041504,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        522.1676025390625,
        527.3871459960938,
        536.610595703125
      ],
      "text": "including linezolid for 2 months and the identical regimen that included ethionamide for 4 months;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        535.3676147460938,
        527.4234008789062,
        549.8106079101562
      ],
      "text": "and second, comparing the outcomes of the 9-month regimen including linezolid with the longer",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        548.567626953125,
        527.2637329101562,
        563.0106201171875
      ],
      "text": "regimens that were designed individually but included both bedaquiline and linezolid along with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        561.767578125,
        527.4528198242188,
        576.2105712890625
      ],
      "text": "other medicines as recommended by WHO. Data on most of the 9-month regimens were obtained",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        574.9675903320312,
        278.01702880859375,
        589.4105834960938
      ],
      "text": "from a programmatic setting in South Africa.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        596.6715087890625,
        527.4256591796875,
        611.114501953125
      ],
      "text": "The first assessment showed similar levels of treatment success (64% vs 66%), failure or recurrence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        609.8715209960938,
        527.2398071289062,
        624.3145141601562
      ],
      "text": "(1.1% vs 1.4%), deaths (20% vs 21%), loss to follow-up (15% vs 12%) and amplification of drug",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        623.071533203125,
        527.4432373046875,
        637.5145263671875
      ],
      "text": "resistance (0.6% vs 0%). AEs were noted in 5% of participants receiving the 9-month regimen with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        636.271484375,
        527.433349609375,
        650.7144775390625
      ],
      "text": "linezolid; however, no comparisons could be made because no data were available for participants",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        649.4716186523438,
        527.3924560546875,
        663.9146118164062
      ],
      "text": "receiving the 9-month regimen with ethionamide. The second assessment of the 9-month regimen",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        662.6715087890625,
        527.4111328125,
        677.114501953125
      ],
      "text": "compared with longer regimens also showed lower levels of treatment success (64% vs 74%), failure",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        675.8715209960938,
        527.4299926757812,
        690.3145141601562
      ],
      "text": "or recurrence (1% vs 3%) or amplification of drug resistance (1% vs 2%); and higher levels of deaths",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        708.6371459960938,
        526.7523193359375,
        722.3410034179688
      ],
      "text": "Extensive (or advanced) pulmonary TB disease is defined as the presence of bilateral cavitary disease or extensive parenchymal damage  32",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 7.989593029022217,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86609649658203,
        721.43701171875,
        526.556884765625,
        731.9409790039062
      ],
      "text": "on chest radiography. In children aged below 15 years, advanced disease is usually defined by the presence of cavities or bilateral",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86609649658203,
        731.037109375,
        180.61090087890625,
        741.5410766601562
      ],
      "text": "disease on chest radiography.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        740.2718505859375,
        526.6334228515625,
        753.9757690429688
      ],
      "text": "Severe extrapulmonary TB is defined as presence of miliary TB, TB meningitis, osteoarticular or pericardial TB. In children aged below  33",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86609649658203,
        753.0718383789062,
        526.5471801757812,
        763.5758056640625
      ],
      "text": "15 years, extrapulmonary forms of disease other than lymphadenopathy (peripheral nodes or isolated mediastinal mass without",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86609649658203,
        762.6718139648438,
        225.05406188964844,
        773.17578125
      ],
      "text": "compression) are considered to be severe.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.23320007324219,
        801.0170288085938,
        136.43409729003906,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "86 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.43649291992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        170.0604705810547,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        172.25680541992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        326.14483642578125,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Module 4: treatment and care",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}